                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg66">p. 66</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d119-f4" n="4" xml:id="d119-f4-content">
                <p>See Churchill’s telegram 493, November 6, 1943, to Roosevelt, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">ante</hi>, <ref target="#pg68">p. 68</ref>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
